Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:02:06.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}卡塔尔 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs40}7{\r\fnTL Score\fs40\c&H9CA793&\b0}-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs40}6{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 奥斯塔彭科 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,everything today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.16,0:00:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,She has done all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.12,0:00:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,她整周都是如此
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:08.40,EN,,0,0,0,,into a second ever career final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:08.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,生涯第二个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and a first at 1000 level.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.40,0:00:11.52,ZH,,0,0,1186,,首个{\fs78}1000{\fs68}赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.80,EN,,0,0,0,,She crushes the dreams
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.52,0:00:12.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她粉碎了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of the big hitting Ostapenko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,重炮手奥斯塔彭科的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Huge congratulations
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.44,0:00:17.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,太祝贺你了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,on this double tie break.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.04,0:00:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,双抢七获胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Close. Fantastic win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.12,0:00:20.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,比分胶着 一场漂亮的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,How pleased
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.56,0:00:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,对自己的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:25.20,EN,,0,0,0,,with your performance, just how was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:25.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,满意吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.20,0:00:26.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,That was probably one of the toughest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这可能是我职业生涯中
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,matches I've probably played.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.96,0:00:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,最艰难的比赛之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.48,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, I knew exactly how she was going
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很清楚她会怎么打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:35.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to play and I just, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.48,0:00:35.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.64,EN,,0,0,0,,she at times she's unplayable
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,她有时候简直不可阻挡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and sometimes you just have to ride
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.64,0:00:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候只能顺着她的节奏走
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that wave and you know, mentally I think
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:40.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但从心理层面说 我觉得
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.84,EN,,0,0,0,,this is one of the best performances I've
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.24,0:00:41.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我职业生涯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:42.72,EN,,0,0,0,,had in my career.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:42.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,发挥最好的一场之一
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, very very proud of that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.72,0:00:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 真的非常非常自豪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So several months ago you had a sideline
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.36,0:01:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,几个月前你还因伤缺阵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,with injury and before the Wuhan open start
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.92,0:01:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,武网开赛前 你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:09.76,EN,,0,0,0,,your single ranking is 170
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.36,0:01:09.76,ZH,,0,0,1186,,单打排名只有{\fs78}170{\fs68}位
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and right now you are back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.76,0:01:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,而现在你打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,EN,,0,0,0,,into the biggest final in your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,职业生涯最重要的一个决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:15.92,EN,,0,0,0,,What are you heading tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.92,0:01:15.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天迎来生涯首个
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.52,EN,,0,0,0,,into your very first WTA 1000 final?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.92,0:01:19.52,ZH,,0,0,1186,,{\fs78}WTA1000{\fs68}决赛 心情如何？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:20.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 你知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:22.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I was I was dreaming of playing this match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.08,0:01:22.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,受伤前身体健康的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,when I was fully fit before the injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.48,0:01:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就梦想着能打这样的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.96,EN,,0,0,0,,So, to be able to come back here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:26.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以能在这里复出
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,in my in my third event
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.96,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,这是我复出的第三站
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and to to achieve this regardless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,能取得这样的成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.40,EN,,0,0,0,,is a is a huge milestone for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:32.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说是巨大的里程碑
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yeah, I'm going to recover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.40,0:01:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我会好好恢复
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and enjoy every second of it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:36.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天享受每一秒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:39.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And one more last question for the fans,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:39.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后一个问题送给球迷们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:41.68,EN,,0,0,0,,they support you all the way as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.52,0:01:41.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,他们一路支持你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I know some some some of the fans
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.68,0:01:43.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道有些球迷
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,they might support Jelena today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.60,0:01:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天可能支持奥斯塔彭科的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,but your performance capturing their eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你的表现征服了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.80,EN,,0,0,0,,on all the way go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.04,0:01:50.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,现场欢呼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've said in every interview,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:52.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的 我每次采访都会说
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,this is an unbelievable court to play in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.80,0:01:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这打球太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,EN,,0,0,0,,The atmosphere in every single match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.72,0:01:57.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一场比赛的现场氛围
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.44,EN,,0,0,0,,has been has been like
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.44,0:01:59.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,都
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.12,EN,,0,0,0,,the most enjoyable experience for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.44,0:02:01.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,是我最享受的体验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:02.72,EN,,0,0,0,,So I appreciate everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:02.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,感谢今天
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:03.92,EN,,0,0,0,,that was supporting me today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.72,0:02:03.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持我的每一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and hopefully they can come out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.92,0:02:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,希望明天你们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.50,EN,,0,0,0,,and do the same
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.44,0:02:07.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,也能来现场继续加油
